## About me and Before I Deploy
I am not a programmer. I use a Mac app called **Before I Deploy** that checks my website before it goes live, and my project is open in it. In the app I have:
- the **Check** button: it checks the whole site again (green = good, red = still broken);
- three small buttons at the top right of the project: a folder (**Show in Finder**), `</>` (**Open in Cursor / VS Code**) and a terminal (**Open in Terminal**, it opens already inside my project folder);
- the **Changes** tab: it shows every file I changed;
- **Smart Deploy**: it publishes the site, and only after the check is green.
Do not tell me to publish with commands: I publish only with Smart Deploy.

